            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुविधा — suvidhā — \"an amenity\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "या विश्रामगृहात सगळ्या सुविधा आहेत. yā viśrāmgṛhāt sagaḷyā suvidhā āhet. This guest house has all the amenities."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun; the plural is the same in the direct case."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
