          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुविधा (suvidhā) is a modern word built from Sanskrit su-, \"good\", and vidhā, \"arrangement, manner\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
