              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पांघरणे — pāṅgharṇe — \"to cover oneself\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रात्री मी जाड चादर पांघरली. rātrī mī jāḍ cādar pāṅgharlī. At night I covered myself with a thick sheet."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने पांघरलं, tyāne pāṅgharlaṁ."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The cover is the object, and the verb agrees with it: चादर पांघरली."
            }
          ]
        },
