          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पांघरणे (pāṅgharṇe) is a Marathi verb for pulling a cover over yourself; its origin is not settled; the noun पांघरूण, a covering, belongs with it."
            }
